WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Okay, okay, as long as the little general doesn't mind

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,320
Fortunately, you have arranged clothes and quilts for everyone

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,720
Otherwise, I'm afraid something big will happen

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,620
From my perspective, it may be getting colder and colder in the past two days. It is indeed the case.

5
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:11,780
Then watch carefully

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:14,860
I'll try to get us more things, by the way

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,340
There's one more thing I'll bring over later for you to take a good look at.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:22,310
You two come in with me, General

9
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:23,790
What is this?

10
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,670
When I moved in just now, I was a veteran.

11
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:27,590
This thing is called Luo Wengang in Dongfang Mansion

12
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:35,900
You can try the magic weapon by cutting it with a knife.

13
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,060
What kind of artifact is this?

14
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,380
No recognition, no front, it’s so hard, that’s right

15
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,700
This thing is called Luo Wengang

16
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,780
I brought it back specially for us to use as weapons.

17
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,100
But it seems inappropriate to just use this weapon

18
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,540
This thing has no edge, no recognition, and the killing effect is not enough.

19
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:49,180
But it is very hard

20
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,180
Suitable for weapons

21
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,260
You guys think of a way

22
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:54,020
Calling all the blacksmiths and casters in our city

23
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,220
Modify this weapon

24
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:56,220
Leave this to me
